<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 176 0 R
/T (Serving as Project Manager during the planning/control and risk-monitoring weeks highlighted the practical difficulty of distinguishing planned responses from verified outcomes. The research contribution further emphasized the importance of transparent documentation so that teams and evaluators can assess what was actually monitored and adjusted.)
/E (Serving as Project Manager during the planning/control and risk-monitoring weeks highlighted the practical difficulty of distinguishing planned responses from verified outcomes. The research contribution further emphasized the importance of transparent documentation so that teams and evaluators can assess what was actually monitored and adjusted.)
